{
  "id": "PRO.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbes 2",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon fils, si tu reçois mes paroles et que tu caches par-devers toi mes commandements",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pour rendre ton oreille attentive à la sagesse, si tu inclines ton cœur à l'intelligence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si tu appelles le discernement, si tu adresses ta voix à l'intelligence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si tu la cherches comme de l'argent et que tu la recherches comme des trésors cachés,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alors tu comprendras la crainte de l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "et tu trouveras la connaissance de",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "donne la sagesse ; de sa bouche [procèdent] la connaissance et l'intelligence :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "il réserve de sains conseils",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "pour les hommes droits ; il est un bouclier pour ceux qui marchent dans l'intégrité,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "protégeant les sentiers de juste jugement et gardant la voie de ses saints",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alors tu discerneras la justice et le juste jugement et la droiture, toute bonne voie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Si la sagesse entre dans ton cœur et si la connaissance est agréable à ton âme,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "la réflexion te préservera, l'intelligence te protégera :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pour te sauver du mauvais chemin, de l'homme qui prononce des choses perverses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[de ceux] qui abandonnent les sentiers de la droiture pour marcher dans les voies de ténèbres,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qui se réjouissent à mal faire, qui s'égaient en la perversité du mal,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dont les sentiers sont tortueux et qui s'égarent dans leurs voies ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pour te sauver de la femme étrangère, de l'étrangère qui use de paroles flatteuses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qui abandonne le guide de sa jeunesse, et qui a oublié l'alliance de son",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ";",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "– car sa maison penche vers la mort, et ses chemins vers les trépassés :",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aucun de ceux qui entrent auprès d'elle ne revient ni n'atteint les sentiers de la vie ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "– afin que tu marches dans la voie des gens de bien, et que tu gardes les sentiers des justes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car les hommes droits habiteront le pays, et les hommes intègres y demeureront de reste ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mais les méchants seront retranchés du pays, et les perfides en seront arrachés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PRO.3",
    "number": "3",
    "bookId": "PRO"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PRO.1",
